The renderer should support these element types:

| Element type          | Purpose                                |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `text`                | Titles, subtitles, labels, disclaimers |
| `image`               | Product photos, logos, backgrounds     |
| `item_card`           | Product or listing card                |
| `section_header`      | Category divider                       |
| `price`               | Price text with special formatting     |
| `badge`               | Sale, used, new, featured, limited     |
| `shape`               | Lines, panels, boxes, separators       |
| `qr_code`             | URL/contact/action QR                  |
| `footer`              | Contact/legal block                    |
| `group`               | Container for grouped elements         |
| `background`          | Solid, gradient, texture placeholder   |
