The `ai_instruction_zone` is useful because some layout regions may need special instructions such as:

* “Preserve this as a footer.”
* “Make this section feel premium.”
* “Do not alter exact product names.”
* “Use this image as the hero product.”
* “Keep these cards aligned in a dense grid.”

