# 22. Validation system

The app should warn the user before export.

Validation warnings:

| Warning               | Example                                 |
| --------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| Missing image         | Item has no assigned image              |
| Text overflow         | Product name too long for selected card |
| Tiny text             | Footer disclaimer below readable size   |
| Too many items        | 31 items on one letter-size flyer       |
| Low image resolution  | Image may look blurry at export size    |
| Unused item           | Item exists but is hidden               |
| Missing price         | Product marked as sellable but no price |
| Missing contact info  | Flyer has no CTA/contact block          |
| Footer/legal overflow | Disclaimer too long for footer          |
| AI-risk warning       | Exact text mode disabled                |

For regulated or sensitive industries, the app should allow required disclaimers and should avoid silently removing them.

