# 25. Export package structure

When the user exports for AI generation, create a ZIP like this:

```text
project-name-ai-handoff.zip
├── README.md
├── prompt.md
├── negative-prompt.txt
├── rough-layout.png
├── rough-layout-background-only.png
├── exact-text-overlay.svg
├── exact-text-overlay.png
├── project.json
├── content.json
├── layout.json
├── brand.json
├── assets/
│   ├── logo.png
│   ├── item-001.jpg
│   ├── item-002.jpg
│   └── ...
└── exports/
    ├── proof.pdf
    └── rough-layout.svg
```

The README should tell the user exactly which files to upload to the image generator and what to do with the result.

