# 35. Strong alternative approach

Instead of building a full visual editor immediately, build a **structured flyer compiler** first.

The first version could be:

1. User fills out CSV/JSON.
2. User selects layout family.
3. App renders 5 layout variants.
4. User picks one.
5. App exports AI handoff package.
6. User imports polished background.
7. App overlays exact text.

This avoids spending months building drag-and-drop editing before proving the core workflow.

Recommended MVP priority:

**Compiler first, editor second.**

